{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2022-03-01 11:00:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY PARTNERS WITH THE HISPANIC ASSOCIATION OF COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES TO DEVELOP HISPANIC LEADERS FOR THE ENERGY INDUSTRY', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA., MARCH 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOMINION ENERGY TODAY ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP WITH THE HISPANIC ASSOCIATION OF COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES (HACU), SUPPORTING SEVEN HIGHER EDUCATION INSTITUTIONS IN VIRGINIA, NORTH CAROLINA, CONNECTICUT, UTAH, AND PUERTO RICO.'}